<title>BANGLADESH: Bangladesh Lamps 1995 net profit rises 3.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh Lamps 1995 net profit rises 3.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1996-09-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The year ended on December 31, 1995.</p>
<p>(In million taka unless stated)</p>
<p>			     1995	     1994</p>
<p>    Profit after tax   35.6    vs     34.5</p>
<p>    Profit before tax  55.3    vs     52.8</p>
<p>    Gross profit	 69.1    vs     67.7</p>
<p>    Sales		 317.6    vs    299.2</p>
<p>    Dividend    40 taka on 100-taka share vs 15 taka.</p>
<p>Note: The company, which uses Philips Electronics NV's Philips brand name, annuanced the dividend on Sunday at its annual general meeting.</p>
</text>
